const rbxStandards={
 ultragui:'Roblox screens: no emoji or symbol characters in any text (they render from the system font and can show as empty boxes); icons are verified image assets, drawn shapes, a ViewportFrame model, or BuilderIcons glyphs. A screen is finished only when every tab and list is filled with real entries, the main button is tied to a selected item, contrast is measured (4.5:1 text, 3:1 large text and icons, inactive tabs still readable, never same-hue text on its plate), text fits with no clipping (fixed sizes plus measured fit; TextScaled only with a size constraint, minimum 12), and a last capture was reviewed. Find pictures with the Creator Store search and look at the thumbnails; a picture must match its label. 3D models inside UI use a ViewportFrame with its own Camera assigned to CurrentCamera (not replicated), sized from GetBoundingBox.',
 ultraanimation:'Roblox animation: assets must be owned by or shared with the experience owner or they silently fail live. Play the local player animations on the client and NPC animations on the server; load each Animation once per Animator and reuse the track; use GetMarkerReachedSignal; tween only anchored parts or UI and on clients.',
 ultravfx:'Roblox effects: Lighting.LightingStyle (Realistic or Soft) and Atmosphere set the mood; avoid partial transparency except glass (overdraw); few shadow-casting lights; Explosion needs DestroyJointRadiusPercent 0 and BlastPressure 0 for visual-only; spawn cosmetic effects on clients and pool them; the server decides outcomes.',
 ultramodelling:'Roblox props from Parts, unions and Luau: decide the one recognisable shape, build big masses then medium shapes then small details, never a plain box or all-default Plastic, use bevel or trim, 3 to 6 colours with a value ladder, at most 3 materials, purposeful wear, pivot at bottom centre, anchored, correct cylinder and wedge orientation. Budgets: meshes up to 20,000 triangles, repeated props about 2,000 to 4,000; CollisionFidelity Box or Hull for decoration; reuse identical meshes so they batch; SurfaceAppearance only on MeshParts with UVs. Parts-only requests stay Parts-only; this overrides generic mesh-workflow advice. Reply with one short line that it is finished.',
 ultraworld:'Roblox worlds: build in studs against a 5 stud character (doors 4 by 7, ceilings 8, steps 1 or less); one module grid (for example 16 studs) with even side lengths; walkable interiors use ModelStreamingMode Atomic; test with StreamingEnabled; check scale next to a character; block out and walk the route before dressing.',
 ultragameplay:'Roblox systems: the server owns currency, rolls, trades and rewards. Economy: sources, sinks and gates on paper first; costs grow exponentially while rewards grow slower; two or three currencies; premium never makes soft currency worthless. Weighted rolls with reused Random and luck applied to weights, not the roll; show true odds. ProcessReceipt in exactly one script, idempotent by PurchaseId, PurchaseGranted only after saving. Session-locked saves, never save unloaded data, BindToClose.',
 ultraaudio:'Roblox audio: follow the project audio system (Audio API or Sound), do not mix them; client-started sounds are heard only by that client; assets must be owned by or shared with the experience owner; give players Music and SFX sliders.',
 ultranetwork:'Roblox networking: RemoteEvent by default, UnreliableRemoteEvent (1000 byte limit) for continuous cosmetic data, never InvokeClient; validate type, range, finiteness, context and rate on every handler; send intent not results; use GetServerTimeNow end times instead of ticks; TeleportData is untrusted; key match data by PrivateServerId; ProximityPrompt and ClickDetector events must be re-checked on the server.',
 ultraperformance:'Roblox performance: 60 FPS is about 16.6 ms; design for low-end Android; measure with the MicroProfiler, Developer Console and Scene Analysis before changing anything; reuse meshes (batching), RenderFidelity Automatic, CollisionFidelity Box or Hull, CanCollide/CanTouch/CanQuery false on decoration; one scheduler loop for NPCs; respect DataStore budgets (reads 60 + 40 per player per minute per server).',
 ultraengineering:'Roblox engineering: no deprecated APIs (task library, Raycast, PivotTo, Animator:LoadAnimation, TeleportAsync, mover constraints, TextChatService); pcall every yielding service call; do not edit Rojo-synced scripts through Studio tools; inspect scripts inside inserted free models; record edits in ChangeHistoryService so the user can undo them.',
 ultraaccessibility:'Roblox input: use the Input Action System for new controls with keyboard, gamepad and touch bindings; honour gameProcessedEvent; branch on PreferredInput not TouchEnabled; no hover-only interactions; gamepad dead zone about 0.15; keep interactive UI inside safe insets; never rely on colour alone.',
 ultraqa:'Roblox QA: playtest with Clients and Servers (2 or more players), use the Device Simulator and Network Simulator, check late joiners, respawn, leaving mid-action, rejoin and save, spammed or malformed remotes, mobile, gamepad and keyboard, and an empty Output. Cite console output, assertions or screenshots; do not claim success without evidence; stop the playtest when done.'
};

